26,18,2061,289,-25,-56,300,57,,,,,"""In this version, we do not implement the transition to denormalized numbers in the case of underflow, so rounding can occur before the exponent check without the risk of double rounding.""",,,,,,,"24.11.2024 21:26:16",
26,39,2061,589,-25,-35,850,36,,,,,"""In the first two cases, rounding is not performed, so overflow is not possible."",""At the implementation level, we skip the overflow check since no actual rounding occurred, but an old carry bit might still be set, which could be interpreted as overflow during rounding, resulting in an incorrect outcome.""",,,,,,,"24.11.2024 21:42:03",
